{{page>meta:infobox:construction&noheader&nofooter&noeditbtn}}

The Linksys MAX-STREAM AC2600 is a dual-band router which features MU-MIMO and 4x4 AC streams. The router is Dynamic Frequency Selection (DFS) certified, which triples the number of channels available at 80MHz. It has a combined speed of 2600Mbps, with 800Mbps for 2.4GHz and 1733Mbps for 5GHz. It has a MediaTek MT7621 800MHz SoC + switch, implementing its 1 WAN port + 4 LAN ports. All 4 antennas are detachable. It also has a USB 2.0 and a USB 3.0 port.

It's powered by a 12V 2.5A adapter, input via a standard 5.5x2.1mm DC barrel jack.

