===== Upgrading OpenWrt =====
->  [[docs:guide-user:installation:generic.sysupgrade]]

Upgrade can be done via LuCI web UI. Under System menu, go to "Backup/Flash Firmware". Find "Flash new firmware image". Click on the flash image button. Next, find where did you place your sysupgrade.bin file by clicking on Browse button then hit Upload. Once done, the router will automatically reboot.

<WRAP BOX>

